OL,3,GNEWSAArmed police arrest man on small
OL,4,AOrkney island
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested by armed police
OL,7,Fon an island in Orkney.
OL,9,FOfficers travelled from mainland
OL,10,FScotland to the island of Flotta and
OL,11,Fexecuted a warrant at around 16:15.
OL,13,FA 61-year-old man was arrested in
OL,14,Fconnection with threatening and abusive
OL,15,Fbehaviour.
OL,17,FCh Insp Scott Robertson said there is
OL,18,Fno risk to the public and inquiries
OL,19,Finto the incident are ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
